  "title": "Unified 3D and 4D Gaussian Reconstruction Frameworks",
  "summary": "S2Tok and DynStream introduce novel methods for streaming 3D and 4D reconstruction from dynamic and unposed video streams, addressing challenges in online processing and rendering.",
